            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JDVMD"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and economical to prepare. I like the fact that you have more flavors to choose from rather than purchasing the usual snow cone syrup flavor. Cheaper too. I put the syrups in some cheap mustard and ketchup bottles I found at Walmart (plastic, like at a diner). Works great.",
